            "name": "Durana Elmi",
            "role": "Co-Founder Cymbiotika",
            "quote": "<p>\"Sleep is one of the most important investments you can make in your health. The Ultimate Snooze has become an essential part of my nightly routine—thoughtfully designed, incredibly comfortable, and made with materials I feel good about bringing into my home.\"</p>",
