            "role": "NASCAR driver",
            "quote": "<p>“If you know me, you know I’ve been focused on optimizing my sleep and recovery—and it’s made a huge difference. After adding the Ultimate Snooze pillow to my routine, this has been another great piece of the puzzle. As a driver, performance starts with recovery—and recovery starts with sleep.”</p>",
